# (1.4.0, the user's: build/design/SET2.md, Transition) a Set's hand-over, the Song mode page's KNOB 2 (LP, Segue, Mix;
# Set mode alone: grey and resting otherwise; global, saved, format 33; a format 32 save reads LP). Values on KNOB 4.
# Segue: no stop, the next piece from the bar after the outro, the echo held under it; Mix: over the last phrase the
# tempo glides to the next piece's, its pulse on the downbeat, its chord no sooner than two bars; after the last piece
# it rests. Each hand-over watched: no stretch under -60 dBFS longer than a bar, no step out of the music's level
listen
wait 1500
expect trans 0
tap GLO
wait 200
tap GLO
wait 400
expect view 28
said Song mode page: Mode Endless, Transition LP, only in Set mode, Grid Off, Values Peek
# Endless: Transition grey, a turn says why and changes nothing
spin K2 1
wait 300
expect trans 0
expect bigring 1
spin K1 2
wait 300
expect par158 2
said Mode Set
spin K2 1
wait 300
said Transition Segue
expect trans 1
spin K2 1
wait 300
said Transition Mix
expect trans 2
spin K2 1
wait 300
expect trans 2
spin K2 -1
wait 300
said Transition Segue
expect trans 1
expect helpfit 0
# two short songs: Basic (no intro, Main 32 bars, Outro 16), then Chamber (Intro 16, Main 32, Outro 16)
turn PRESET 1
wait 600
tap HOME
wait 200
tap HOME
wait 300
spin K1 -2
spin K2 -16
spin K3 -2
wait 300
turn PRESET -1
wait 600
spin K1 -4
spin K2 -16
spin K3 -2
wait 300
expect piece 0
tap PLAY
wait 500
tap PLAY
wait 300
trwatch
# Basic's outro at bar 32 (62.9 s at 122), its last bar 47 (92.5 s): the cue there, Chamber set under it
wait 92000
expect piece 0
expect song 3
wait 1500
expect trcue 1
expect piece 1
expect playing 1
wait 2500
expect trcue 0
expect piece 1
expect playing 1
expect song 1
expect trrestarts 1
expect bpm 128
wait 10000
expect playing 1
expect trquiet <2000
# (step 5's Basic: the stab thrown into the held echo has a sharp edge; its repeats, a dotted 8th apart, read 94-97)
expect trclick <110
# Mix: Pressure (126) to Haze (116), the same lengths; the last piece's end: it rests
tap PLAY
wait 500
expect playing 0
tap GLO
wait 200
tap GLO
wait 300
spin K2 1
wait 300
expect trans 2
turn PRESET 6
wait 600
expect piece 7
tap HOME
wait 200
tap HOME
wait 300
spin K1 -2
spin K2 -16
spin K3 -2
wait 300
turn PRESET -1
wait 600
expect piece 6
spin K1 -4
spin K2 -16
spin K3 -2
wait 300
tap PLAY
wait 300
trwatch
# bar 40 at 126: 76.2 s; the glide from bar 39 to 47, half way about bar 43 (81.9 s)
wait 74000
expect bpm 126
wait 8000
expect bpm >118
expect bpm <124
wait 8800
expect bpm 116
wait 3000
expect piece 7
expect playing 1
expect trrestarts 1
expect trkick <2
expect trchord -1
wait 8000
expect trchord >31
expect trquiet <2000
expect trclick <80
# (1.4.2: no hole, mixgap.amb: never 12 LU under the music for more than about a bar; no swell over it)
expect trhole <2100
expect trswell <60
# Haze, the last: its song to its end (64 bars at 116), then it rests
wait 130000
expect piece 7
expect playing 0
# a Mix's glide under way, the outro called back (HOME held + PLAY): the piece's own tempo again
turn PRESET -1
wait 600
expect piece 6
tap PLAY
wait 82000
expect bpm <124
press HOME
tap PLAY
release HOME
wait 300
said OUTRO OFF
expect bpm 126
expect song 2
tap PLAY
wait 500
# kept by a save and a reboot; a format 32 save reads LP
press GLO
wait 700
release GLO
wait 300
reboot
wait 1000
expect format 35
expect trans 2
store32
reboot
wait 1000
expect format 35
expect trans 0
expect par158 2
